{
    "title": "Testframe: Rate Attractiveness",
    "description": "How to get more matches on tinder or likes on instagram? Am I pretty? How attractive am I? How do you know where you are on an attractiveness scale? How do I find the best photo and choose profile pictures? What is my attractiveness score? You may have similar questions.\r\n\r\nTestframe is a large photo testing network. You can test and rate dating, social and business pics. Our app makes it easy to rate photos and get objective feedback from a community of friendly users.\r\n\r\nOur privacy-focused approach allows you to control when, to whom and for how long your pics are visible. You can target voters by gender and age to get relevant reviews, and our moderation system ensures that all interactions are respectful and constructive.\r\n\r\nTry it today and find your best profile photos!\r\n\r\nHow does it work?\r\n1. To use Testframe, first upload a picture and select a category (e.g dating).\r\n2. You can earn energy by ranking other people's images, or buy coins to speed up test results.\r\n3. Once picture has been tested, you can review and rank it.\r\n\r\nTo use social review system for free, you must earn energy by rating others' pictures. Alternatively, you can purchase coins to skip the energy-earning process and buy rating directly.\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions or need help, our support team is here to help. Don't hesitate to contact us.",
    "descriptionHTML": "How to get more matches on tinder or likes on instagram? Am I pretty? How attractive am I? How do you know where you are on an attractiveness scale? How do I find the best photo and choose profile pictures? What is my attractiveness score? You may have similar questions.<br><br>Testframe is a large photo testing network. You can test and rate dating, social and business pics. Our app makes it easy to rate photos and get objective feedback from a community of friendly users.<br><br>Our privacy-focused approach allows you to control when, to whom and for how long your pics are visible. You can target voters by gender and age to get relevant reviews, and our moderation system ensures that all interactions are respectful and constructive.<br><br>Try it today and find your best profile photos!<br><br>How does it work?<br>1. To use Testframe, first upload a picture and select a category (e.g dating).<br>2. You can earn energy by ranking other people&#39;s images, or buy coins to speed up test results.<br>3. Once picture has been tested, you can review and rank it.<br><br>To use social review system for free, you must earn energy by rating others&#39; pictures. Alternatively, you can purchase coins to skip the energy-earning process and buy rating directly.<br><br>If you have any questions or need help, our support team is here to help. Don&#39;t hesitate to contact us.",
